            "review_title": "Review at Chilli - Lau Nuong Tu Chon",
            "review_text": "TimG\nMerseyside, United Kingdom183 contributions\n0\nAmazing BBQ joint\nApr 2024 • Family\nWe stumbled upon this place on food street in District 4. A lot of the tables had a live bbq on or next to the table and the smell was amazing. We ordered a mix of seafood and beef which they cooked for us next to the table. The food was sensational. With beers the whole meal was about $12. An amazing experience\nWritten April 13, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
