            "review_title": "Review at Chilli - Lau Nuong Tu Chon",
            "review_text": "Aurora T\nMalang, Indonesia351 contributions\n0\n24 flavored Oysters!\nJan 2018 • Couples\nThe highlight of this place is probably the oysters. It is pretty viral on social medias. The menu is in Vietnamese, the staff couldnt really speak good english. When you ordered, there is a staff who would cook the oysters before you. The price is crazy cheap! We ordered another beef soup in coconut milk which was delicious. It looks like they served worm dishes too... I suggest bringing a Vietnamese native whenever you can. Some of the oysters have fruity flavors which wasn’t my cup of tea but my boyfriend seems to love it...\nRead more\nWritten January 19, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
