            "review_text": "travellingjj\nBangkok, Thailand248 contributions\n0\nAmazing oysters in 20 sauces.\nJul 2017 • Friends\nWe read about this place on facebook before we came. So we HAD to have the 20 oysters before we go eat other Vietnamese dishes. It really didn't disappoint. Dress down as it's a humble street side restaurant. \nIt was AMAZING. All 25 oysters plus a Mango Lassi costs us 500,000 dong, which is approximately S$30.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 17, 2017",
